# fixedbugs, defect 2409's shape, 2026-11-10: a field the header has only
# inside a member whose type is named `unioné` stopped `heroes build` at exit
# 134, *string slice splits a character*, in `cli/member_ask.hero`'s
# `kind_of`, which cut the member's type text at `union `'s length. It is
# asked of the bytes now (`cli/strings.starts_with`), and the field is told
# where the header has it, with what builds, at exit 1.

extern "fixedbugs-2409-a-member-inside-a-type-named-above-ascii-is-told.h"
    record Tagged tag tagged
        kind: i32
        fd: i32  #~ ffi_unknown_field

function main()
    t = Tagged(kind: 2, fd: 3)
    print(t.kind)
